{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>Contact • {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <style>
    :root{
      --accent:#6A8E77; --accent-2:#D3C5A8; --bg:#FBFBFA; --muted:#6B6B6B; --card:#ffffff;
      --radius:14px; --shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(20,20,20,0.08);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--bg) 45%, #F3F7F3 45%);color:#13221F}
    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:28px 40px}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--accent) 0%, #2F5E4A 100%);display:grid;place-items:center;color:white;font-weight:700}
    nav a{margin-left:18px;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600}
    nav a:last-child{color:var(--accent)}

    .split-hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 520px;gap:28px;align-items:center;padding:36px 40px}
    .hero-copy{padding:34px;background:linear-gradient(160deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.6), rgba(243,247,243,0.6));border-radius:18px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0;font-size:28px;line-height:1.08}
    p.lead{margin:0 0 18px 0;color:var(--muted)}
    .primary-cta{display:inline-block;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:white;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}
    .secondary-cta{margin-left:12px;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid #E4E7E3;color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none}

    .card{background:var(--card);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:var(--shadow)}
    .inventory{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px}
    .grid-areas{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:10px}
    label.area{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px dashed #E9EFE9}
    label.area input{width:18px;height:18px}

    .result{margin-top:10px;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;background:#FBFFF9;border:1px solid #EEF6EE}
    .agenda{margin:0;padding:0 0 0 18px}

    .cta-row{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;margin-top:14px}

    footer{padding:28px 40px;display:flex;gap:28px;align-items:flex-start}
    .contact-form{flex:1;display:grid;gap:10px}
    input,textarea,select{padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #E6EAE6}
    button{padding:10px 14px;border-radius:10px;border:0;background:var(--accent);color:white;font-weight:700}

    .try-btn{padding:9px 12px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #DDE8DF;background:transparent;color:var(--accent);cursor:pointer}

    /* Modal */
    .modal-backdrop{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(6,10,8,0.45);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center}
    .modal{width:720px;max-width:94%;background:white;border-radius:14px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(10,20,15,0.45)}
    .modal .tabs{display:flex;gap:8px;margin-bottom:12px}
    .modal .tabs button{flex:1;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid #E6EAE6;background:#FAFEFB}
    .breathing-svg{width:120px;height:120px;display:block;margin:18px auto}
    .timer{font-size:22px;text-align:center;margin-top:6px}

    /* small screens */
    @media (max-width:880px){
      .split-hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:16px}
      .grid-areas{grid-template-columns:1fr}
      footer{flex-direction:column}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <div class="brand">
      <div class="logo">H</div>
      <div>
        <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
        <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav>
      <a href="index.html">Home</a>
      <a href="services.html">Programs</a>
      <a href="conditions.html">Conditions</a>
      <a href="approach.html">Process</a>
      <a href="pricing.html">Invest</a>
      <a href="about.html">Story</a>
      <a href="book.html">Join</a>
      <a href="contact.html">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="split-hero">
      <div class="hero-copy card">
        <h1>Together, we'll map what matters most.</h1>
        <p class="lead">A practical first step: collect a clear view of body, sleep, mood, movement and rhythms so your first conversation is focused and useful. Build a consultation agenda and a follow-up cadence in moments.</p>
        <div class="cta-row">
          <a class="primary-cta" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <button class="secondary-cta try-btn" id="open-exercise">Try a short practice</button>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">Prefer phone? Call <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</div>
      </div>

      <aside class="card">
        <h3 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Whole-person inventory</h3>
        <p style="margin:0 0 12px 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Check the areas you want explored in your intake; we’ll translate selections into a practical agenda and a suggested follow-up rhythm for a cohort plan or individual consult.</p>

        <div class="inventory">
          <div class="grid-areas" id="areas">
            <label class="area"><input type="checkbox" value="Sleep"/>Sleep patterns</label>
            <label class="area"><input type="checkbox" value="Energy"/>Daily energy</label>
            <label class="area"><input type="checkbox" value="Digestion"/>Digestion</label>
            <label class="area"><input type="checkbox" value="Movement"/>Movement & mobility</label>
            <label class="area"><input type="checkbox" value="Stress"/>Stress management</label>
            <label class="area"><input type="checkbox" value="Mood"/>Mood & resilience</label>
            <label class="area"><input type="checkbox" value="Focus"/>Focus & cognition</label>
            <label class="area"><input type="checkbox" value="Immune"/>Immune support</label>
          </div>

          <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
            <button id="generate">Create agenda</button>
            <button id="clear" style="background:#F4F8F4;color:var(--accent);border:1px solid #E7EEE4">Clear</button>
            <button id="copy" class="try-btn">Copy agenda</button>
          </div>

          <div id="output" class="result" aria-live="polite" style="display:none">
            <strong>Suggested consultation agenda</strong>
            <ol id="agenda-list" class="agenda"></ol>
            <div style="margin-top:8px"><strong>Suggested follow-up cadence:</strong> <span id="cadence" style="color:var(--accent)"></span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </section>

    <!-- Modal for guided practice -->
    <div class="modal-backdrop" id="modal">
      <div class="modal" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-title">
        <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center">
          <h3 id="modal-title" style="margin:0">Short practice — breathe, write, or set an intention</h3>
          <button id="close-modal" class="try-btn">Close</button>
        </div>
        <div class="tabs" role="tablist">
          <button data-tab="breathe">Breathe</button>
          <button data-tab="journal">Journal</button>
          <button data-tab="intention">Intend</button>
        </div>
        <div id="tab-content">
          <!-- breathe -->
          <div data-panel="breathe">
            <svg class="breathing-svg" viewBox="0 0 120 120" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <defs>
                <linearGradient id="g" x1="0" x2="1">
                  <stop offset="0" stop-color="#6A8E77"/>
                  <stop offset="1" stop-color="#D3C5A8"/>
                </linearGradient>
              </defs>
              <circle cx="60" cy="60" r="40" fill="url(#g)" opacity="0.12" />
              <circle id="pulse" cx="60" cy="60" r="24" fill="#6A8E77" opacity="0.9" />
            </svg>
            <div style="text-align:center">
              <div class="timer" id="breathe-timer">Guide: Inhale 4 — Hold 4 — Exhale 6</div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;justify-content:center;margin-top:10px">
                <button id="start-breathe" class="try-btn">Start</button>
                <button id="stop-breathe" class="try-btn">Stop</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- journal -->
          <div data-panel="journal" style="display:none">
            <p style="color:var(--muted)">A short prompt and a 3-minute timer. Write without editing.</p>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <textarea id="journal-input" rows="6" style="flex:1"></textarea>
            </div>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:8px">
              <button id="start-journal" class="try-btn">Start 3-min timer</button>
              <div id="journal-timer" style="font-weight:700;color:var(--accent)"></div>
              <button id="save-journal" style="margin-left:auto" class="try-btn">Save note</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- intention -->
          <div data-panel="intention" style="display:none">
            <p style="color:var(--muted)">Choose a short intention and one small step to carry it into the day.</p>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
              <select id="intention-select">
                <option>Choose an intention...</option>
                <option value="Be kinder to myself">Be kinder to myself</option>
                <option value="Pause before reacting">Pause before reacting</option>
                <option value="Focus on breath for 3 minutes">Focus on breath for 3 minutes</option>
                <option value="Move for 10 minutes">Move for 10 minutes</option>
              </select>
              <input id="intention-step" placeholder="One small step (e.g., 2-min walk)" />
              <button id="save-intention" class="try-btn">Set</button>
            </div>
            <div id="intention-confirm" style="margin-top:10px;color:var(--accent)"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="card contact-form">
      <h3 style="margin:0 0 6px 0">Get in touch</h3>
      <p style="margin:0 0 10px 0;color:var(--muted)">For cohort questions, bookings, or a quick consult, fill this out and we’ll follow up within a few business days.</p>
      <input placeholder="Your name" id="c-name" />
      <input placeholder="Email" id="c-email" />
      <input placeholder="Phone (optional)" id="c-phone" />
      <textarea placeholder="Tell us briefly what you'd like help with" id="c-message" rows="4"></textarea>
      <div style="display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center">
        <button id="submit-contact">Send message</button>
        <a href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" class="try-btn" style="margin-left:auto">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
      </div>
      <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:8px">We provide educational guidance and cohort support; our offerings are not medical cures. If you have urgent or emergency concerns, call local emergency services.</div>
    </div>

    <div style="width:320px">
      <div class="card" style="padding:14px">
        <strong>Quick contacts</strong>
        <div style="margin-top:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px">Phone: <a href="tel:{{PHONE}}">{{PHONE}}</a><br>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></div>
        <div style="margin-top:12px">
          <button id="open-exercise-2" class="try-btn">Try a short practice</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    // Inventory logic: build agenda + cadence
    (function(){
      const generate = document.getElementById('generate');
      const clear = document.getElementById('clear');
      const copyBtn = document.getElementById('copy');
      const output = document.getElementById('output');
      const agendaList = document.getElementById('agenda-list');
      const cadence = document.getElementById('cadence');

      function getCheckedAreas(){
        return Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('#areas input:checked')).map(i=>i.value);
      }

      function prioritize(items){
        // playful prioritization: order by category importance heuristics
        const weight = {Sleep:5, Energy:4, Stress:4, Mood:3, Digestion:3, Movement:3, Focus:2, Immune:2};
        return items.sort((a,b)=> (weight[b]||1) - (weight[a]||1));
      }

      function suggestCadence(count){
        if(count===0) return 'No follow-up suggested — select areas to see options.';
        if(count<=2) return 'Two 1:1 visits over 6 weeks + weekly check-ins via group chat.';
        if(count<=4) return 'A 6-week cohort with biweekly check-ins and 15-min weekly touchpoints.';
        return 'An 8-week cohort with weekly learning sessions + 10-min weekly accountability check-ins.';
      }

      generate.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const picked = getCheckedAreas();
        if(picked.length===0){
          output.style.display='block';
          agendaList.innerHTML='<li style="color:var(--muted)">No areas selected</li>';
          cadence.textContent = suggestCadence(0);
          return;
        }
        const ordered = prioritize(picked);
        agendaList.innerHTML = ordered.map(a=>'<li>'+a+': gather baseline history, 2 tests/observations, and short-term goals</li>').join('');
        cadence.textContent = suggestCadence(ordered.length);
        output.style.display='block';
      });

      clear.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        document.querySelectorAll('#areas input').forEach(i=>i.checked=false);
        output.style.display='none';
      });

      copyBtn.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const text = Array.from(agendaList.querySelectorAll('li')).map(li=>li.textContent).join('\n');
        if(!text){alert('No agenda to copy');return}
        navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText(text).then(()=>{
          copyBtn.textContent='Copied!'; setTimeout(()=>copyBtn.textContent='Copy agenda',1200);
        });
      });
    })();

    // Modal + guided practice logic
    (function(){
      const modal = document.getElementById('modal');
      const open = document.getElementById('open-exercise');
      const open2 = document.getElementById('open-exercise-2');
      const close = document.getElementById('close-modal');
      const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.modal .tabs button');
      const panels = document.querySelectorAll('[data-panel]');

      function showModal(){ modal.style.display='flex'; showPanel('breathe'); }
      function hideModal(){ modal.style.display='none'; stopBreathe(); stopJournalTimer(); }

      open.addEventListener('click', showModal);
      open2.addEventListener('click', showModal);
      close.addEventListener('click', hideModal);
      modal.addEventListener('click', (e)=>{ if(e.target===modal) hideModal(); });

      tabs.forEach(t=>t.addEventListener('click', ()=> showPanel(t.dataset.tab)));
      function showPanel(name){ panels.forEach(p=>p.style.display=(p.getAttribute('data-panel')===name? 'block':'none')); }

      // Breathing: simple pulse + timer sequence
      let breatheInterval=null; let step=0;
      const pulse = document.getElementById('pulse');
      const startB = document.getElementById('start-breathe');
      const stopB = document.getElementById('stop-breathe');
      const breatheTimer = document.getElementById('breathe-timer');

      function animatePulse(scale){ pulse.setAttribute('transform','scale('+scale+') translate(10 10)'); }
      function breatheSequence(){
        // cycle: inhale 4, hold 4, exhale 6 measured in 1s ticks
        const phases = [ {label:'Inhale',len:4,scale:1.5}, {label:'Hold',len:4,scale:1.5}, {label:'Exhale',len:6,scale:0.6} ];
        let phaseIndex=0, tick=phases[0].len;
        breatheTimer.textContent = phases[phaseIndex].label + ' ' + tick;
        breatheInterval = setInterval(()=>{
          tick--;
          if(tick<=0){ phaseIndex=(phaseIndex+1)%phases.length; tick=phases[phaseIndex].len; }
          const current = phases[phaseIndex];
          breatheTimer.textContent = current.label + ' ' + tick;
          animatePulse(current.scale);
        },1000);
      }
      function stopBreathe(){ if(breatheInterval){clearInterval(breatheInterval);breatheInterval=null; breatheTimer.textContent='Guide: Inhale 4 — Hold 4 — Exhale 6'; animatePulse(1);}}
      startB.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ stopBreathe(); breatheSequence(); });
      stopB.addEventListener('click', stopBreathe);

      // Journal timer (3 minutes)
      const startJournal = document.getElementById('start-journal');
      const journalTimerEl = document.getElementById('journal-timer');
      const journalInput = document.getElementById('journal-input');
      const saveJournal = document.getElementById('save-journal');
      let journalInterval=null;

      function startJournalTimer(){ let t=180; journalTimerEl.textContent=formatTime(t); journalInterval=setInterval(()=>{t--; journalTimerEl.textContent=formatTime(t); if(t<=0){stopJournalTimer();}},1000); }
      function stopJournalTimer(){ if(journalInterval){clearInterval(journalInterval);journalInterval=null;journalTimerEl.textContent='';}}
      function formatTime(s){ const m=Math.floor(s/60); const sec=s%60; return m+':'+String(sec).padStart(2,'0'); }
      startJournal.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ journalInput.focus(); startJournalTimer(); });
      saveJournal.addEventListener('click', ()=>{ const txt=journalInput.value.trim(); if(!txt){alert('No note to save');return} navigator.clipboard && navigator.clipboard.writeText(txt).then(()=>{ saveJournal.textContent='Saved'; setTimeout(()=>saveJournal.textContent='Save note',1200); }); });

      // Intention
      const intentionSelect = document.getElementById('intention-select');
      const intentionStep = document.getElementById('intention-step');
      const saveInt = document.getElementById('save-intention');
      const confirm = document.getElementById('intention-confirm');
      saveInt.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const i = intentionSelect.value; const s = intentionStep.value.trim();
        if(!i || i==='Choose an intention...'){ alert('Pick an intention'); return; }
        confirm.textContent = 'Set: "'+i+'" — Step: '+(s||'(no step provided)');
        // small ephemeral storage
        setTimeout(()=>confirm.textContent='',5000);
      });
    })();

    // Contact form small client-side interaction
    (function(){
      const submit = document.getElementById('submit-contact');
      submit.addEventListener('click', ()=>{
        const name=document.getElementById('c-name').value.trim();
        const email=document.getElementById('c-email').value.trim();
        if(!name||!email){ alert('Please add name and email'); return; }
        submit.textContent='Sending...';
        setTimeout(()=>{ submit.textContent='Send message'; alert('Thanks — we will contact you at '+email); document.getElementById('c-name').value=''; document.getElementById('c-email').value=''; document.getElementById('c-phone').value=''; document.getElementById('c-message').value=''; },1200);
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"Contact page and usage notes for the split_diagonal cohort site chunk.

Files in this chunk:
- contact.html — interactive contact + whole-person inventory + guided practice modal.

How to test locally:
1. Drop contact.html into the project root (alongside the other pages).
2. Open contact.html in a modern browser.

Main features implemented on contact.html:
- Whole-person inventory: check areas and click "Create agenda" to produce a prioritized consultation agenda plus a suggested follow-up cadence. The agenda is based on a simple heuristic and can be copied to clipboard.
- Guided practice modal: accessible via "Try a short practice" buttons. Three short guided mini-practices are provided entirely in front-end JS:
  - Breathe: a cyclical inhale-hold-exhale guide with a pulsing circle and countdown.
  - Journal: a 3-minute timed writing prompt with a save-to-clipboard action.
  - Intention: select or type a short intention and a tiny step; it shows confirmation.
- Contact form: simple front-end validation and simulated send with a friendly acknowledgment. No server calls included; replace with your API endpoint if needed.

Notes & considerations:
- Placeholders present and required by the template: {{BUSINESS_NAME}}, {{TAGLINE}}, {{PHONE}}, {{EMAIL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}, {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}, {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}. Replace them in your templating pipeline.
- UI is self-contained: no external fonts or assets are required. The layout references an SVG pattern in other chunks (assets/img/pattern.svg) but none is required for the contact page to function.
- This page intentionally uses educational, supportive language and includes a short disclaimer in the contact card. It does not promise cures and is suitable for integrative/holistic health contexts.

Customization pointers:
- Adjust the cadence logic inside the inventory script to match your program offerings (cohort vs individual cadence).
- Hook the contact form to your backend by replacing the simulated send with fetch()/XHR.
- The guided practices are intentionally minimal; enhance timers, accessibility announcements, or audio cues as desired.

If you need a variant of this page with different nav labels, or integration with a booking endpoint, tell me which booking system or API you plan to use and I will update the contact form accordingly."}
BUNDLE_END
